==Description==
'''Worried Scout''' is an exclusive sticker obtained from the [[Null & Void Event]]. It was obtained from Level 7 of the regular track, which had a cost of {{GumDrops|130}} or {{Robux|56}} to unlock, with a total cost of {{GumDrops|480}} or {{Robux|272}}. Prior to the 20% discount, it had a cost of {{Robux|71}} to unlock, with a total cost of {{Robux|345}}.

==Appearance==
'''Worried Scout''' showcases a head split in half by a line. On the left side, the [[Null Scout]] can be seen, while on the right, a worried default [[Scout]] is visible.

